  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Negativa:** sujeto + **don't / doesn't** + verbo base.",
      "*I don't work. She doesn't work.*",
      "",
      "**Pregunta:** **Do / Does** + sujeto + verbo base.",
      "*Do you work? Does she work?*",
      "",
      "**Respuestas cortas:** *Yes, I do. / No, I don't. · Yes, she does. / No, she doesn't.*",
      "",
      "**Con preguntas Wh-:** *What time do you get up?*",
      "",
      "Después de *does / doesn't* el verbo **no lleva -s**: *She doesn't work* (no *works*)."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "She doesn't works.",
        "right": "She doesn't work.",
        "note": "Con does/doesn't el verbo no lleva -s."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "I no work on Sundays.",
        "right": "I don't work on Sundays.",
        "note": "La negativa se forma con don't, no con 'no'."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
